<blockquote class="govuk-body govuk-!-font-size-36 ndx-headline-moment">
  "I've reviewed your photo; environmental health will visit Wednesday, ref ABC123."
</blockquote>

<p class="govuk-body">That single sentence is the headline moment this scenario exists to demonstrate. It's what a council CIO will remember and what a Director of Customer Services will photograph for their own CIO.</p>

<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">What to do</h3>

<ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number govuk-list--spaced">
  <li>Open the companion web app and add <code>?step=4</code> to the URL. <strong>All three panes brighten.</strong></li>
  <li>From the same phone you used in Step 1, dial the real UK number again.</li>
  <li>Listen.</li>
</ol>

<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">What's happening</h3>

<p class="govuk-body">When the call lands, the contact flow searches Connect Cases for an open case linked to your phone number, updated within the last hour. It finds the case Step 1 created and Step 3 updated with the photo description. The bot then reads back a single sentence assembled from the case fields and the photo description.</p>

<p class="govuk-body">All three panes are bright now: the live transcript on the left shows your dial-back, the Connect Case in the middle shows one ticket with no duplicates, and the photo upload simulator on the right shows your earlier photo attachment.</p>

